    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The 6th Hybrid Annual Pakistan Paediatric Neuro-Oncology Symposium (PNOS), held over three days, brought together experts, clinicians, and trainees to explore the theme \"Global Standardization in the Management of Childhood Brain Tumors.\" Organized by the Department of Oncology in collaboration with the Department of Continuing Professional Education at the Aga Khan University, the event reflected a collective commitment to advancing care for children facing one of the most complex and life-threatening paediatric cancers.",
